sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Surface (--ui / autodoc.nvim / --call)
    participant Socket as Unix Socket (0600)
    participant Daemon as autodoc --serve
    participant Store as SQLite WAL Store (core/store)

    Client->>Socket: Dial autodoc.sock (server.socket, else $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR, else macOS $TMPDIR, else $XDG_STATE_HOME/autodoc)
    alt Socket unreachable or missing
        Client->>Daemon: Spawn background autodoc --serve
        Daemon->>Store: Acquire single-writer lease (flock on .autodoc-lease-device-inode)
        Daemon->>Socket: Bind 0600 Unix domain socket
        Socket-->>Client: Connection established
    else Daemon already running
        Socket-->>Client: Connection established
    end
    Client->>Daemon: Internal handshake sys.hello ({protocol, name})
    Daemon-->>Client: Response {protocol, server_protocol, min_protocol, version, pid, store_id, client, events}
    Client->>Daemon: Request search.query / doc.read / todos.list
    Daemon->>Store: Read snapshot (concurrent WAL reader)
    Store-->>Daemon: Rows & ranked chunks
    Daemon-->>Client: msgpack-RPC response payload
